<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA EXTENDS GAINS AT MORNING PRICE FIX.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA EXTENDS GAINS AT MORNING PRICE FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
